From e2a6aa8c2d0001e3e3818c7b10d583055b1304d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maximilian <m.marowsky@googlemail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:36:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 209/210] Aurora: DOL_AURORA_TEXTURE_REPORT_MISSING lists the
 textures an HD pack has no file for

Each texture the game draws that the pack misses is logged once with the file name the pack
would need (tex1_WxH_hash[_tlut]_fmt.dds); 2 also lists the pack's nearest candidates. With the
host's texture dumps on, the missing texture is written as an editable RGBA DDS under the cache
folder's texture_dumps, ready to be painted or upscaled and dropped into the pack.
---
 .../graphics/aurora/lib/gfx/gxcore_draw.cpp   |  4 ++
 .../aurora/lib/gfx/texture_replacement.cpp    | 50 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../aurora/lib/gfx/texture_replacement.hpp    |  6 +++
 3 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

